Package: fwmanager
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, ufw, pkexec | policykit-1, dbus, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), network-manager
Description: beginner-friendly firewall with a profile per network (for ufw)
 fwmanager is a window and a command line for ufw. Pick a profile (Home, Work,
 Public) for each network and fwmanager switches to it when you join that
 network. Every change is undone after 30 seconds unless you confirm it, so a
 mistake cannot lock you out.
 .
 The window needs GTK 4 and libadwaita 1.5 or newer; the command line
 (fwmanager-cli) works without them.
